    "name": "Running Riot",
    "steam_appid": 2284000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Running Riot</strong> gauntlet, where you'll engage in <strong>heart-pounding</strong> combat against enemies trying to take you down! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Devastating Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're no pushover. You'll gain Upgrades as you level up, making your abilities stronger. Your choices will determine whether victory will be yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class comes with its own set of unique abilities, upgrades, and meta-progression perks. Classes present new playstyles to master and new opportunities to nail that <strong>perfect run</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Score Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run grants you Running Riot <strong>Tickets </strong>based on how high you score. Use those tickets to buy perks and get even higher scores! So keep on <i>running</i>, keep on <i>rioting</i>, and you'll keep on finding more explosive ways to play! Don't forget to see how you rank amongst other players.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Running Riot</strong> gauntlet, where you'll engage in <strong>heart-pounding</strong> combat against enemies trying to take you down! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Devastating Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're no pushover. You'll gain Upgrades as you level up, making your abilities stronger. Your choices will determine whether victory will be yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class comes with its own set of unique abilities, upgrades, and meta-progression perks. Classes present new playstyles to master and new opportunities to nail that <strong>perfect run</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Score Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run grants you Running Riot <strong>Tickets </strong>based on how high you score. Use those tickets to buy perks and get even higher scores! So keep on <i>running</i>, keep on <i>rioting</i>, and you'll keep on finding more explosive ways to play! Don't forget to see how you rank amongst other players.</p>",
    "short_description": "Pick a class and blast your way through rooms of cyber enemies in this roguelite action shooter! Choose your abilities and your path wisely, because you've only got one life to make it through the gauntlet. Rack up those points and spend them on even more ways to RIOT!",
